=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Teams Choose FeedOps as a Feedonomics Alternative<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7817a87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7817a87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 data-start=\"5136\" data-end=\"5187\"><strong data-start=\"5139\" data-end=\"5187\">AI + Human Expertise for Better Feed Quality<\/strong><\/h3><p data-start=\"5189\" data-end=\"5260\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\">FeedOps<\/a> combines AI automation with hands-on review from feed analysts.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1fd8b64 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1fd8b64\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bdc05ec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bdc05ec\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54488b6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"54488b6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">AI improves:<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-37a49a3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"37a49a3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1ac054 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"c1ac054\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<l