st-text\">Fix feed and Merchant Center issues fast<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cac72ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cac72ff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We keep the onboarding simple so you can start improving your feed right away.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95a4af2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"95a4af2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0c15dc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e0c15dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f0ebc7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4f0ebc7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Transparent Pricing (No Surprises)<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f1ad7c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4f1ad7c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"6440\" data-end=\"6526\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\">FeedOps<\/a> offers predictable pricing starting at <strong data-start=\"6487\" data-end=\"6509\">$350 USD per month\u00a0<\/strong>, which includes:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f7d84fe e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f7d84fe\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;bac