589-171.204c4.704-4.668 4.734-12.266.067-16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Faster support<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e6c25a1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e6c25a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><p data-start=\"7046\" data-end=\"7087\">Here\u2019s how the main alternatives compare:<\/p><h3><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\"><strong data-start=\"7093\" data-end=\"7107\">1. FeedOps<\/strong><\/a><\/h3><p data-start=\"7110\" data-end=\"7194\">Best for continuous optimization, Merchant Center support, and Shopping performance.<\/p><h3><strong data-start=\"7200\" data-end=\"7266\">2. Built-In Ecommerce Apps (Shopify, BigCommerce, WooCommerce)<\/strong><\/h3><p data-start=\"7269\" data-end=\"7335\">Best for simple, basic feeds.<br data-start=\"7298\" data-end=\"7301\" \/>Not good for performance or scale.<\/p><h3><strong data-start=\"7341\" data-end=\"7377\">3. Marketplace Syndication Tools<\/strong><\/h3><p data-start=\"7380\" data-end=\"7475\">Best for Amazon\/eBay\/Walmart distribution.<br data-start=\"7422\" data-end=\"7425\" \/>Not built for Shopping, PMax, or ROAS-driven work.<\/p><p data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"264\">We also bill in <strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"188\">Australian Dollars<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"211\">Singapore Dollars<\/strong>, and <strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"240\">New Zealand Dollars<\/strong> for regional customers.<br \/>There are no hidden fees. You know exactly what you\u2019re paying for.<\/p><\/div><p data-start=\"6631\" data-end=\"6699\">Feedonomics uses custom quotes, which makes comparisons harder.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t